# Frontend Pages Guide

The main frontend pages are located in the [pages/](mdc:pages) directory. Key sections include:

- Authentication: [pages/login/](mdc:pages/login), [pages/register/](mdc:pages/register), [pages/forgot-password/](mdc:pages/forgot-password), [pages/reset-password/](mdc:pages/reset-password), [pages/logout/](mdc:pages/logout)
- Dashboard: [pages/dashboard/](mdc:pages/dashboard)
- Audit: [pages/audit/](mdc:pages/audit)
- Developer Tools: [pages/devtool/](mdc:pages/devtool)
- Home: [pages/index.vue](mdc:pages/index.vue)

Each section may have subpages for specific features or workflows.
